From fc4e9df4e81bd9dee68112122348df52a046fe1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhiwei Yang <quic_zhiwyang@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Dec 2022 14:42:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] qcacld-3.0: Support 4 virtual interfaces

Support 4 virtual interfaces,include 1STA and 3SAP
in the DBS/SCC mode.

Signed-off-by: zhiwyang <quic_zhiwyang@quicinc.com>
